<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Student Attendance Management System</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #eaf2f8;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 30px 15px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px #cccccc;
        }
        h1 { color: #2457a7; text-align: center; }
        .cards {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .card {
            flex: 1 1 180px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #f4f7fb;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h2 { color: #2457a7; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Student Attendance Management System</h1>
        <p>Welcome! Manage student attendance easily.</p>

        <h2>Features</h2>
        <div class="cards">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Student Registration</h3>
                <p>Add student details.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Mark Attendance</h3>
                <p>Record daily attendance.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>View Attendance</h3>
                <p>Check attendance records.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Reports</h3>
                <p>View attendance summaries.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
